# Git and commit preferences

This repo: features `feature/<user>/development/<name>` → merge **`development`** without feature PRs. Never develop on `master` unless asked. Local branch + worktree on shared VM. Sibling tool remotes usually land on `master` (confirm `git ls-remote --symref origin HEAD`). Full: `docs/git-commit-preferences.md`.
